{"type":"Film","id":"FR2015_004","slug":"fr2015-004-valentin-valentin","title":{"native":"Valentin Valentin","english":"Valentin Valentin"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-01-07","year":2015},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Pascal Thomas","slug":"pascal-thomas","name":"Pascal Thomas","birthYear":1945,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy","Detective Thriller"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/242/16/135410/format_page/valentin-valentin.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qm7b5bB4Xb0"},"synopsis":{"native":"Dans ce « fenêtres sur cour » qui se déroule dans un petit immeuble parisien, tout un monde hétéroclite gravite, s’aime, s’observe sans toujours se voir. C’est là que vit Valentin, jeune homme mélancolique, charmant, partagé entre sa maîtresse au tempérament insatiable, les trois jeunes filles du cinquième étage qui tournent autour de lui, une gardienne démonstrative et une belle chinoise dont la présence dans la maison d’en-face l’intrigue et le fait rêver. À quoi pense-t-il ? Que dissimule-t-il ? Que cherche-t-il ? Valentin invite tous ses voisins à sa pendaison de crémaillère, sans se douter qu’il déclenche ainsi une spirale de violences…","english":"In the \"rear window\" that unfolds in a small, Parisian building, a diverse group of people crosses paths, likes and observes each other, without always seeing each other. Valentin lives here. He's a melancholy but charming young man caught between his insatiable mistress, the three young women on the fifth floor who flirt with him, a demonstrative concierge, and a beautiful Chinese woman, whose presence in the building opposite intrigues him. What does he thing about? What is he hiding? What is he looking for? Valentin invites all his neighbor's to his house-warming party, without ever thinking that by doing so he set off a spiral of violent reactions."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Alain Kruger","slug":"alain-kruger","name":"Alain Kruger","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Alexandra Stewart","slug":"alexandra-stewart","name":"Alexandra Stewart","birthYear":1939,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Canada","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Arielle Dombasle","slug":"arielle-dombasle","name":"Arielle Dombasle","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Bernard Chapuis","slug":"bernard-chapuis","name":"Bernard Chapuis","birthYear":1945,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Christian Morin","slug":"christian-morin","name":"Christian Morin","birthYear":1945,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"François Morel","slug":"francois-morel","name":"François Morel","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Geraldine Chaplin","slug":"geraldine-chaplin","name":"Geraldine Chaplin","birthYear":1944,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"United States of America (the)","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Pascal Bonitzer","slug":"pascal-bonitzer","name":"Pascal Bonitzer","birthYear":1946,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Pascal Thomas","slug":"pascal-thomas","name":"Pascal Thomas","birthYear":1945,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Philippe Caroit","slug":"philipp